UnitV2Gauge::ClaimReferralEmissions
├── when the caller is not the referral or an approved operator
│   └── it should revert with NotAuthorized
├── when the recipient is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the referral has no deferred emissions
│   └── it should not mint emissions
├── when emission minting reverts
│   ├── it should revert
│   └── it should preserve the deferred referral emissions
├── when the caller is the referral
│   ├── it should emit the ReferralEmissionsClaimed event
│   ├── it should clear the deferred referral emissions
│   └── it should mint the full balance to the recipient
└── when the caller is an approved operator
    ├── it should emit the ReferralEmissionsClaimed event
    ├── it should clear the deferred referral emissions
    └── it should mint the full balance to the recipient
